om in Malad West offers modern and spacious 2 & 3 BHK homes that are designed for a superior, family-centric lifestyle. It boasts an incredibly extensive range of amenities, including multiple sports facilities, pools, and dedicated leisure zones for all age groups. The project focuses on providing a complete, self-sufficient environment with a strong emphasis on recreation, wellness, and vibrant community living.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\nProject Type\n\n#### Project Type\n\nStatus\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\nProject Area\n\n#### Project Area\n\n2.84 acres\n\nTowers\n\n#### Towers\n\n5\n\nConfigurations\n\n#### Configurations\n\n1, 2 & 3 BHK Apartments\n\nTotal Floors\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\nAmenities\n\n#### Amenities\n\n17 Amenities\n\nParking","score":0.8978479,"raw_content":null,"id":"fd5f80-00"},{"url":"https://ruparelstardom-malad.in","title":"Ruparel Stardom Malad West | 2 & 3 BHK at Mumbai","content":"Ruparel Stardom Malad West is a Project by Ruparel Realty situated in the most premium location of Mumbai, Malad West, offers 2 & 3 BHK Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications. Ruparel Realty Ruparel Stardom Mumbai has 4 Towers of G+49Storeys. Ruparel Stardom Mumbai Maha RERA P51800055521 with Carpet of 2 BHK 744 sqft to 3 BHK 1259 sqft, with Starting Price 2.35Cr. Ruparel Realty Mumbai Property Features Amenities like Swimming Pool, Jogging Track, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Senoir Citizen area, Children Play Area, Yoga Meditation Zone, Chess, Mini theater, Sports Court, Banquet Hall, Mulipurpose Hall. Ruparel Stardom [...] What amenities are provided at Project Name?\n\nThe project includes over 25 amenities such as Swimming Pool, Jogging Track, Clubhouse, Gymnasium, Indoor Games, Senoir Citizen area, Children Play Area, Yoga Meditation Zone, Chess, Mini theater, Sports Court, B